    <briefdescription>
<para>Build-time configuration for Baton. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The application provides <computeroutput>baton_user_config.h</computeroutput> on the include path (copy <computeroutput>config/baton_user_config_template.h</computeroutput>). It must define the two message lists BATON_STATE_LIST and BATON_EVENT_LIST and may override any size below; a size can also be set with a compiler definition (for example <computeroutput>-DBATON_MAX_NODES=4U</computeroutput>). Every node of a bus must be built with the same message lists.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Configuration elements in this group:</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="group__baton__config_1gac945ab04f822245f06d48e2212d60495" kindref="member">BATON_MAX_NODES</ref> : nodes on the bus including the master. </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para><ref refid="group__baton__config_1gad90f1d88dfbd073c0d75b8e55b439d39" kindref="member">BATON_MAX_PAYLOAD</ref> : largest frame payload. </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para><ref refid="group__baton__config_1ga4aff6201a1db6da6d4f01e0902e24662" kindref="member">BATON_MAX_MSGS_PER_FRAME</ref> : messages packed into one frame. </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para><ref refid="group__baton__config_1gaa74471c86e5a7dbbe460983d74d53319" kindref="member">BATON_QUEUE_HIGH_SIZE</ref>, <ref refid="group__baton__config_1ga62bb4b6203994c62ecbcf85c30cf4ac0" kindref="member">BATON_QUEUE_NORMAL_SIZE</ref> : event queues. </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para><ref refid="group__baton__config_1ga4e72afa2275bb5636293fb8942969689" kindref="member">BATON_RX_BUF_SIZE</ref> : receive ring filled from the UART interrupt. </para>
</listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
